{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_019pcvLazmhwPErh8VnxUXiQ","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Plan — catalogue-title\n2\t\n3\t## Context\n4\tProduct context, feature `catalogue` (`product/spec/product/catalogue/scenarios.md`). Adopt mode: `status: adopted` — the shop already titles the catalogue page; nothing is built, no production code or existing test changes.\n5\tCarrier: in-session, `dca-modelling` not needed — adopt mode names no domain element.\n6\t\n7\t## Changes\n8\t| Element | Kind | Location | New or changed | Evidence |\n9\t| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n10\t| none — adopt mode | — | — | — | story front matter `status: adopted` |\n11\t\n12\t## Acceptance criteria\n13\t- catalogue-tab-reads-product-catalog  →  level: e2e — Playwright (`./gradlew test-e2e`), happy path\n14\t\n15\t## Where the behaviour lives\n16\t| Key | Behaviour | Covered by |\n17\t| --- | --- | --- |\n18\t| catalogue-tab-reads-product-catalog | `src/main/java/dev/domaincentric/sample/ecommerce/product/adapter/incoming/web/ProductCatalogPageViewModel.java:33` sets \"Product Catalog\"; `ProductPageController.java:71` puts it as `title`; `src/main/resources/templates/layout.pug:7` renders it | `src/test-e2e/java/dev/domaincentric/sample/ecommerce/e2e/CatalogTitleE2ETest.java` — `CatalogTitleE2ETest.catalogPageIsTitledProductCatalog` |\n19\t\n20\t## Spec delta\n21\t- adds catalogue-tab-reads-product-catalog\n22\t\n23\t## Invariants\n24\t(none — adopt mode changes no domain type)\n25\t\n26\t## Files\n27\t- `src/test-e2e/java/dev/domaincentric/sample/ecommerce/e2e/CatalogTitleE2ETest.java` — read: the existing test that covers the criterion\n28\t- `src/main/java/dev/domaincentric/sample/ecommerce/product/adapter/incoming/web/ProductCatalogPageViewModel.java` — read: where the title is set\n29\t\n30\t## Open assumptions\n31\t- The title is also asserted under CAT-01's `catalogue-page-heading` (`product/spec/product/catalogue/scenarios.md:36`, `src/test-integration/java/dev/domaincentric/sample/ecommerce/product/ProductCatalogPageIntegrationTest.java:108`); this story adds its own key so both shops hold the same spec (story Notes, WP-107). The overlap is a finding for the spec's owner, not resolved here.\n32\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"294c7f0b-b8a0-4e13-b1d0-25291ebde5c5","uuid":"9f0d18b0-ea41-42a7-97bc-962ff2f12dfc","timestamp":"2026-10-12T20:40:51.186Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/christoph/Privat/domain-centric-architecture/dca-ecommerce-sample-java/.dca-factory/runs/catalogue-title/plan.md","content":"# Plan — catalogue-title\n\n## Context\nProduct context, feature `catalogue` (`product/spec/product/catalogue/scenarios.md`). Adopt mode: `status: adopted` — the shop already titles the catalogue page; nothing is built, no production code or existing test changes.\nCarrier: in-session, `dca-modelling` not needed — adopt mode names no domain element.\n\n## Changes\n| Element | Kind | Location | New or changed | Evidence |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| none — adopt mode | — | — | — | story front matter `status: adopted` |\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n- catalogue-tab-reads-product-catalog  →  level: e2e — Playwright (`./gradlew test-e2e`), happy path\n\n## Where the behaviour lives\n| Key | Behaviour | Covered by |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| catalogue-tab-reads-product-catalog | `src/main/java/dev/domaincentric/sample/ecommerce/product/adapter/incoming/web/ProductCatalogPageViewModel.java:33` sets \"Product Catalog\"; `ProductPageController.java:71` puts it as `title`; `src/main/resources/templates/layout.pug:7` renders it | `src/test-e2e/java/dev/domaincentric/sample/ecommerce/e2e/CatalogTitleE2ETest.java` — `CatalogTitleE2ETest.catalogPageIsTitledProductCatalog` |\n\n## Spec delta\n- adds catalogue-tab-reads-product-catalog\n\n## Invariants\n(none — adopt mode changes no domain type)\n\n## Files\n- `src/test-e2e/java/dev/domaincentric/sample/ecommerce/e2e/CatalogTitleE2ETest.java` — read: the existing test that covers the criterion\n- `src/main/java/dev/domaincentric/sample/ecommerce/product/adapter/incoming/web/ProductCatalogPageViewModel.java` — read: where the title is set\n\n## Open assumptions\n- The title is also asserted under CAT-01's `catalogue-page-heading` (`product/spec/product/catalogue/scenarios.md:36`, `src/test-integration/java/dev/domaincentric/sample/ecommerce/product/ProductCatalogPageIntegrationTest.java:108`); this story adds its own key so both shops hold the same spec (story Notes, WP-107). The overlap is a finding for the spec's owner, not resolved here.\n","numLines":32,"startLine":1,"totalLines":32}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_019pcvLazmhwPErh8VnxUXiQ","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
