{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017U5rzc947myuAfE4xekrtq","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tid: catalogue-title\n3\tepic: browse-catalogue\n4\tstatus: adopted\n5\tcontext: product\n6\tfeature: catalogue\n7\ttitle: The catalogue page is titled \"Product Catalog\"\n8\tdepends_on: []\n9\t---\n10\t\n11\t# The catalogue page is titled \"Product Catalog\"\n12\t\n13\t## Story\n14\t\n15\tAs a visitor I want the catalogue page's title to read \"Product Catalog\" so that the tab names the page.\n16\t\n17\t## Acceptance criteria\n18\t\n19\t### Rule: The catalogue page carries the catalogue's name as its title\n20\t\n21\t#### catalogue-tab-reads-product-catalog (happy path)\n22\tTitle: The catalogue page is titled Product Catalog\n23\t- Given the seeded sample catalogue\n24\t- When a visitor opens the catalogue page\n25\t- Then the page title is \"Product Catalog\"\n26\t\n27\t## Notes\n28\t\n29\t- The .NET shop delivered this criterion as a change story; here the behaviour exists and is adopted, so that both shops hold the same spec (WP-107).\n30\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"294c7f0b-b8a0-4e13-b1d0-25291ebde5c5","uuid":"680e49f8-1990-41cf-b2a4-fcadfb7a7843","timestamp":"2026-10-12T20:40:55.166Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/christoph/Privat/domain-centric-architecture/dca-ecommerce-sample-java/product/epics/browse-catalogue/catalogue-title/story.md","content":"---\nid: catalogue-title\nepic: browse-catalogue\nstatus: adopted\ncontext: product\nfeature: catalogue\ntitle: The catalogue page is titled \"Product Catalog\"\ndepends_on: []\n---\n\n# The catalogue page is titled \"Product Catalog\"\n\n## Story\n\nAs a visitor I want the catalogue page's title to read \"Product Catalog\" so that the tab names the page.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n### Rule: The catalogue page carries the catalogue's name as its title\n\n#### catalogue-tab-reads-product-catalog (happy path)\nTitle: The cata